        "workingTitle": "Sol ring",
        "releaseTitle": "Sol ring (Det går over)",
        "releaseDate": "",
        "sequenceId": 14,
        "state": "finished",
        "format": "single",
        "promoText": "This is a new take on a production I made during the pandemic but never released. It came together in the first months of claustrophobia. Off-pattern chord droning in a lo-fi 8-bit feel. One of the first tracks where I tried vocals. Deep bass and breakbeats pushing energy into what feels like an immovable object. Written/created in July 2020, re-structured and re-mixed in Reaper DAW, June 2026. Status: finished, but unmastered.",
