    {
        "isin": "",
        "year": 2026,
        "workingTitle": "Blueprint (nomelody 2013 archive remix)",
        "releaseTitle": "Blueprint (nomelody 2013 archive remix)",
        "releaseDate": "",
        "sequenceId": 15,
        "state": "finished",
        "format": "single",
        "promoText": "Originally created in 2013 as nomelody, built on Monomachine and Machinedrum playing off each other. In many ways it is a blueprint for my hardware-based electronic sound. The rule was simple: no melodies allowed. It is one of the heavier electronic/techno tracks I have released, and it still holds up 13 years later. It also does not really follow standard EDM timings; the structure is more restless and slightly hectic, which is part of what gives it its drive. I recently did a quick remix and decided it was worth bringing back.",
        "production": {},
        "feedbackText": "",
        "artworkUrl": "",
